			"notes": "## CLU 5.3.0\n### changes \n- added Craftite (raw and refined) to make creative casing\n- Fixed recipes, inconsistincy where cheese_block.json was a duplicate and no way to turn liquid cheese to cheese block (now spout liquid cheese into composter and crush it) \n- Fixed saturation levels of cheesy bread and peppermint hot chocolate (create: food compat)\n- Fixed Translation for peppermint hot chocolate not showing up"
